  S" /dev/null" R/O OPEN-FILE THROW  DUP PL-PREV ! PL-FD+ ;
: PL-SPAWN ( --- job )   \ the pipeline started, not waited for: its pids kept, its last returned
  PL-NP @ 0 ?DO  PL-PIDS I CELLS + @  JB-N @ I JB-PID !  LOOP
  PL-NP @  JB-N @ CELLS JB-NP + !
  PL-PIDS PL-NP @ 1- CELLS + @  DUP JB-N @ CELLS JB-KEY + !  1 JB-N +!
  R-SIG-CATCH
  -1 PL-DEPTH +!  PL-DEPTH @ IF PL-RESTORE THEN ;
: R-JOBS-STOP ( --- )   \ the script ending: TERM to every stage of every job not waited for
  JB-N @ 0 ?DO  JB-NP I CELLS + @ 0 ?DO  J I JB-PID @ 15 KILL DROP  LOOP  LOOP  0 JB-N ! ;
